## Data Management

### File Types in CICS

#### 1. VSAM (Virtual Storage Access Method)

```
VSAM Dataset Types:
├─ KSDS (Keyed Sequential Data Set)
│  └─ Most common, indexed by key
│  
├─ ESDS (Entry Sequenced Data Set)
│  └─ Access by position
│  
├─ RRDS (Relative Record Data Set)
│  └─ Access by record number
│  
└─ LDS (Linear Data Set)
   └─ Large data, unstructured
```

#### 2. Temporary Storage

```
Two Types:
├─ Main Storage TS
│  └─ Fast, volatile (lost if CICS stops)
│  
└─ Auxiliary Storage TS
   └─ Persistent (survives failures)
   └─ Slower than main storage
```

#### 3. Transient Data

```
Characteristics:
├─ Queue-like structure (FIFO)
├─ Can trigger transactions
├─ Recoverable
└─ Useful for inter-transaction communication
```

